.TH K2HVEC "1" "September 2026" "K2HVEC" "Vector database/search Library"
.SH NAME
K2HVEC \- A high-performance vector database for fast vector search, built on top of the K2HASH key-value store.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.SS library
.TP
\fBlibk2hvec.so
.SS tool for library
.TP
\fBk2hveclinetool [options]
.TP
\fBk2hvecpmtool [options]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B K2HVEC
is a high-performance, KVS-based vector database built on top of the K2HASH key-value store. 
It uses vector embeddings (floating-point arrays generated by AI or machine learning models) as keys to store arbitrary values, delivering fast and accurate vector similarity searches.

.IP \(bu 3
.B Arbitrary Value Storage:
Stores arbitrary user data associated with corresponding vector embeddings as keys.
.IP \(bu 3
.B Fast Vector Search:
Performs high-speed vector similarity searches using specified vector embeddings.
.IP \(bu 3
.B Full K2HASH Feature Inheritance:
Inherits all native features of K2HASH, including data encryption, expiration limits (TTL), and custom attributes.

.PP
