.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
\fBVECDBGMODE\fR
VECDBGMODE environment sets debugging message level. The value is set as SILENT, ERR, WAN, INFO or DUMP.
When SIGUSER1 signal is caught, the debugging message level is bumpup. The level is changed as order by SILENT, ERR, WAN, INFO, DUMP, SILENT...
.TP
\fBVECDBGFILE\fR
VECDBGFILE environment sets the file which is debugging message.
.SH NOTES
.TP
k2hlinetool, k2hreplace, k2hcompress, k2htouch, k2hedit is tool for k2hash file/memory.
.TP 0
k2hveclinetool is an interactive tool for managing and configuring K2HVEC databases.
.TP 0
k2hvecpmtool is a standalone tool for generating projection matrix data used by K2HVEC.
